  "body": "Set on an exceptional 2,365sqm landholding privately positioned well back from the road and accessed via an exclusive driveway and commanding sweeping views across the Hauraki Gulf, this landmark residence represents a rare opportunity to secure a private estate of remarkable scale, architectural pedigree and enduring quality.\r\n \r\nOriginally designed by renowned architect Horace Massey, this home has been extensively enhanced with significant recent upgrades throughout and contributions from renowned Scarlett architects, Jen Pack, landscaping - Suzanne Turley and others combining timeless architecture with exceptional modern comfort and liveability. Generous living and entertaining spaces flow effortlessly to beautifully landscaped grounds, creating an outstanding setting for both family living and large-scale entertaining.\r\n \r\nOffering approximately 477sqm of accommodation, the residence features four bedrooms plus study, multiple living zones including home theatre and games room, a flexible layout designed to adapt to the needs of growing families and multi-generational living alike.  A floodlit all-weather tennis court, skateboard mini ramp, heated pool, spa and multiple outdoor entertaining areas all add to this outstanding lifestyle opportunity.\r\n \r\nComplementing the extensive amenities is substantial vehicle accommodation, including a three-car garage and off-street parking for six or more vehicles, ideal for large families, guests and entertaining on a grand scale.\r\nPositioned moments from Kohimarama Beach, the waterfront, local cafés and sought-after schooling, this is a property that delivers prestige, lifestyle and convenience in equal measure.\r\n \r\nA once-in-a-generation Eastern Bays estate where architectural heritage, modern luxury and family lifestyle combine on a scale rarely found today.",
